Package: jarvis-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-wl (= @VERSION@), xdg-utils, flatpak
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ app tools (MCP server)
 Lists installed apps (APT and Flatpak), opens, focuses and closes apps and
 windows, opens files and links with the default app and sets default apps,
 for the Jarvis agent.
